 "headline": "Nova Knicks Ride Waiver Wire To Lead",
 "notes": [
  "Nova Knicks just stole FT% from Zero Fox Given, flipping a 5-6 deficit into a 6-4 lead while Wembanyama drops 18 on 7-10 shooting.",
  "Thug Life leads the night on volume, nine players with a stat, but Toumani Camara is 0-4 from the field and bleeding percentages.",
  "Thug Life took 3PTM from BrookynDynasty while Jaden McDaniels hit 3 triples without a miss, 11 points on 4-4. BrookynDynasty answered by taking TO back.",
  "Zero Fox Given let Kyrie Irving sit on the bench for 17 points and 2 steals, then watched FT% walk across the street.",
  "LeParth James grabbed FT% from White Mambas, and Damian Lillard's 16 points and 3 threes are the reason. Kris Dunn contributed 2 points and a pulse."
 ],
